  "security_implications": "The chunk exposes boot status integrity (via Mubi4-checked greenlight done/good flags) and the SoC debug state to the JTAG debug interface. The missing assignment for ROM slot 0 done (line 274) may leave boot_greenlight_done.d[0] stale, causing a debugger to incorrectly conclude that ROM0 boot completed, which can conceal a critical boot failure. Additionally, soc_dbg_state_i is directly connected to JTAG without integrity hardening; if this signal can be faulted, the debug trace may report a false state, undermining security monitoring and potentially hiding rogue debug activity.",
